 {"recommendationid": "196599011", "author": {"steamid": "76561199524651365", "personaname": "mgarber001", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199524651365/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 134, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 134, "last_played": 1749233255, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Nah. It's just monotonously running around chasing the next way point icon and emptying your rifle at way too many targets to really enjoy every 3 or 4 minutes. Over and over. No way provided to actually absorb any kind of story or atmosphere.  Maybe that's the way it's supposed to be but the sheer repetition turns to annoyance quickly.  Which just as quickly turns to numb boredom.  If you've never worked on an assembly line, you can get the same \"mind on a hook\" apathetic blur-dom in an hour without leaving the couch by playing this game. So glad I only paid $7.  I suppose that's about right in quarters at an arcade console before walking away and never putting another quarter in that machine.", "timestamp_created": 1749278683, "timestamp_updated": 1749278948, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.524058520793914795", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "196594199", "author": {"steamid": "76561199261601477", "personaname": "Blue", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199261601477/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 258, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 258, "last_played": 1752177432, "avatar": "b2c921cf0739ce72761f4e720c3853475b82a184"}, "language": "english", "review": "Played with a friend for a b